qvf provides CMake targets:

  find_package(qvf CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE qvf::qvf)

qvf::qvf requires C++17. A C-only target still links the C++ runtime:

  set_target_properties(main PROPERTIES LINKER_LANGUAGE CXX)

qvf also provides pkg-config metadata (qvf.pc) and the single header
<qvf/qvf_single.hpp>.
